Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 04:10:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/19] CUDA: faster f32 -> f16 conversion and Q6_K/Q5_K -> f16
 dequantization

The prompt path expands activations and weights to f16 for rocBLAS. Contiguous conversion now moves 4
values a thread with 16-byte loads (from qr0n/p100-llama-cpp), and Q6_K/Q5_K dequantize 32/16
consecutive outputs a thread through shared memory. P100, 4096x14336 Q6_K: 506 -> 323 us per call.
GGML_CUDA_DEQ_FAST=0 restores the generic dequantizers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
